1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,080
But everyone in that meeting was lying, including you.

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:08,080
Someone said, Context window, the whole room nodded, almost nobody knew what it meant.

3
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:11,120
And that nod is how broken AI products get built.

4
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:13,640
Nobody asks, so the team builds on a guess.

5
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:15,800
Someone assumes the AI remembers everything.

6
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:16,800
It doesn't.

7
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:20,640
Weeks later, users complain it forgot what they said five minutes ago, and nobody

8
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:21,640
knows why.

9
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:27,600
Pop quiz, what's a Context window, three seconds.

10
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:29,980
It's how much the AI can hold in its head at once.

11
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:33,180
It's short-term memory, one sentence, that's all it ever was.

12
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:37,220
The person who asks, wait, what does that mean, isn't the slowest in the room, they're

13
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:39,060
the only one not guessing.

14
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:44,020
Want the other 24, comment jargon, and I'll send you all 25 AI words, each explained

15
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:45,180
in one line.

16
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:46,100
No lying this time.
